  "description": "The target is dual-stack and the endpoint prefers IPv6. Local IPv6 connectivity is lost, so the default connection starts failing while forcing IPv4 still works. This is the shape of a real IPv6 brownout, and the condition Network Bisect isolates as LOCAL_CAPABILITY_DEFICIENCY.",
